      "devanagari": "मयि ते यदि अनुक्रोशो यदि रक्षःसु तेषु च |\nरामेण यदि शक्तिः ते तेजो वा अस्ति निशा चर\nदण्डकारण्य निलयम् जहि राक्षस कण्टकम् |",
      "iast": "mayi te yadi anukrośo yadi rakṣaḥsu teṣu ca |\nrāmeṇa yadi śak{}tiḥ te tejo vā asti niśā cara\ndaṇḍakāraṇya nilayam jahi rākṣasa kaṇṭakam |",
      "translation": "\"If you have mercy on me, and even on those dead demons, and if ability and animation are still left in you to cope with Rama, oh, nightwalker, kill that Rama who is a thorn in the side of demons dwelling in Dandaka forest.",
